# Shortcut Studio settings. Copy this file to backend/.env and fill in what you use:
#   cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
# backend/.env is ignored by git; never commit real keys. Variables set in your shell
# override this file. Restart the backend after changing it.

# --- API keys ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# AgentRouter (agentrouter.org): one key for Claude and one for DeepSeek. With either, the AI defaults to the
# automatic chain Claude → DeepSeek → Groq: a service that is down or rate-limited is skipped and rechecked later.
# Each can also be chosen on its own in the AI model picker.
AGENTROUTER_CLAUDE_KEY=
AGENTROUTER_DEEPSEEK_KEY=
# Or a single AgentRouter key used for both:
# AGENTROUTER_API_KEY=
# Your personal DeepSeek key (platform.deepseek.com, pay as you go): a separate choice, not in the chain
# unless you add deepseek-api to SHORTCUT_AI_CHAIN.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# SHORTCUT_DEEPSEEK_API_MODEL=deepseek-chat
# Optional: client headers AgentRouter asked you to send, as a JSON object, e.g. {"X-Header": "value"}.
# AGENTROUTER_HEADERS=
# AGENTROUTER_BASE_URL=https://agentrouter.org/v1
# SHORTCUT_CLAUDE_MODEL=              (empty: the newest Claude Sonnet it offers)
# SHORTCUT_DEEPSEEK_MODEL=            (empty: the newest DeepSeek chat model it offers)

# Groq (console.groq.com): hosted transcription and highlight picking.
GROQ_API_KEY=
# ElevenLabs (elevenlabs.io): ElevenLabs voices in Voice Studio.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# Free platforms offered when Groq hits a usage limit (or set SHORTCUT_LLM_PROVIDER to use one):
# Google Gemini (aistudio.google.com), free tier.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# OpenRouter (openrouter.ai), free gpt-oss-120b with daily request limits.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# SambaNova (cloud.sambanova.ai), free tier, runs gpt-oss-120b.
SAMBANOVA_API_KEY=

# Video Maker stock footage (both free; one is enough, or use a plain background without any):
# Pexels (pexels.com/api): 200 requests per hour.
PEXELS_API_KEY=
# Pixabay (pixabay.com/api/docs): 100 requests per minute.
PIXABAY_API_KEY=
# Coverr (cinematic stock video): no sign-up page; email team@coverr.co describing your use to get a key.
COVERR_API_KEY=
# Unsplash photos, shown with a slow zoom (unsplash.com/developers → New application → Access Key).
# A new app starts in demo mode: 50 requests per hour.
UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=
# Wikimedia Commons real-world video and photos need no key.
# Optional private SearXNG instance for live web-image research. DuckDuckGo is the keyless fallback.
# SEARXNG_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8888

# Video Maker background music: Jamendo (devportal.jamendo.com), free client ID; Creative Commons tracks.
JAMENDO_CLIENT_ID=
# Your email or website. Wikimedia Commons asks apps to identify themselves with a contact and may refuse
# whole-file music downloads without one. Only sent to Wikimedia (and in other stock-site requests).
SHORTCUT_CONTACT=

# --- Providers and models (optional; defaults shown) --------------------------------
# The AI for highlights, scripts and plans: auto (the chain below; default when AGENTROUTER_API_KEY is set),
# or one of groq, claude, deepseek, gemini, openrouter, sambanova (default without AgentRouter: groq).
# A single named service that hits a usage limit pauses and asks you to wait or switch; the chain only asks
# when every service in it is down.
# SHORTCUT_LLM_PROVIDER=auto
# SHORTCUT_AI_CHAIN=claude,deepseek,groq
# SHORTCUT_CLAUDE_RECHECK_MINUTES=10
# SHORTCUT_DEEPSEEK_RECHECK_MINUTES=3
# SHORTCUT_GROQ_LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b
# SHORTCUT_GROQ_FAST_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b
# Your Groq tier's tokens-per-minute limit; long transcripts are split to fit (0 = never split).
# SHORTCUT_GROQ_TPM=8000
# SHORTCUT_GEMINI_MODEL=            (empty: the newest Flash model on your account)
# SHORTCUT_OPENROUTER_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b:free
# SHORTCUT_SAMBANOVA_MODEL=gpt-oss-120b

# Transcription: groq (hosted Whisper) or local (faster-whisper on this computer).
# SHORTCUT_TRANSCRIBER=groq
# SHORTCUT_GROQ_WHISPER_MODEL=whisper-large-v3-turbo
# SHORTCUT_WHISPER_MODEL=small
# SHORTCUT_WHISPER_DEVICE=auto
# SHORTCUT_WHISPER_COMPUTE=int8

# Voice Studio local model: kokoro-v1.0.onnx, kokoro-v1.0.fp16.onnx or kokoro-v1.0.int8.onnx.
# SHORTCUT_KOKORO_MODEL=kokoro-v1.0.onnx
# SHORTCUT_ELEVENLABS_API=https://api.elevenlabs.io

# --- Server (optional; for a live server) -------------------------------------------
# `python -m app` / ./studio.sh listen here. Pick a port no other site on the server uses.
# SHORTCUT_HOST=127.0.0.1
# SHORTCUT_PORT=8000
# Login prompt for every page and API call. Set a password on any public server; leave empty locally.
# SHORTCUT_AUTH_USER=admin
# SHORTCUT_AUTH_PASSWORD=
# Only needed if the frontend is served from a different address than the backend.
# SHORTCUT_CORS_ORIGINS=https://studio.example.com
# Built frontend the backend serves when present (npm run build).
# SHORTCUT_FRONTEND_DIST=frontend/dist

# --- Paths (optional) ---------------------------------------------------------------
# SHORTCUT_DATA_DIR=backend/data
# SHORTCUT_FFMPEG=ffmpeg
# SHORTCUT_FFPROBE=ffprobe
# SHORTCUT_YT_DLP=yt-dlp
